    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL SELECT para BigQuery que identifica los registros individuales de dispensación o administración (drug_exposure) que conforman un episodio de exposición farmacológica continua (drug_era):\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    de.person_id,\n    de.drug_exposure_id,\n    de.drug_concept_id,\n    de.drug_exposure_start_date,\n    de.drug_exposure_end_date,\n    der.drug_era_id,\n    der.drug_era_start_date,\n    der.drug_era_end_date\nFROM\n    `drug_exposure` AS de\nJOIN\n    `drug_era` AS der\n    ON de.person_id = der.person_id\n    AND de.drug_concept_id = der.drug_concept_id\n    AND de.drug_exposure_start_date >= der.drug_era_start_date\n    AND de.drug_exposure_end_date <= der.drug_era_end_date\nORDER BY\n    de.person_id, de.drug_concept_id, de.drug_exposure_start_date;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnwBjz1rX34bGhR9wIvKS8lT5VOgQAnBdCqeGrb_RcU4tzVYKwNCDEL3RRpw3jZ1We9VexBv3UYnxGHS72yEg6cF0MyoNbs33_xIO_Hl7C6MjRNj8HuOlxQ-qBZ8e39CyMPHIziQF6o0Q-rHg_v0PVTcmc_QRkite1MQ-YbG"
