    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Gracias por las valiosas observaciones del evaluador clínico/técnico. He revisado y mejorado la consulta SQL para BigQuery OMOP CDM 5.4, incorporando la tabla `concept_ancestor` para manejar las relaciones jerárquicas de conceptos de drogas y ajustando las condiciones temporales.\n\nAquí tienes la consulta SQL corregida y ejecutable:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    de.person_id,\n    de.drug_exposure_id,\n    de.drug_concept_id AS exposure_drug_concept_id,\n    c_de.concept_name AS exposure_drug_name,\n    de.drug_exposure_start_date,\n    de.drug_exposure_end_date,\n    der.drug_era_id,\n    der.drug_concept_id AS era_drug_concept_id,\n    c_der.concept_name AS era_drug_name,\n    der.drug_era_start_date,\n    der.drug_era_end_date\nFROM\n    `drug_exposure` AS de\nJOIN\n    `concept_ancestor` AS ca\n    ON de.drug_concept_id = ca.descendant_concept_id\nJOIN\n    `drug_era` AS der\n    ON de.person_id = der.person_id\n    AND ca.ancestor_concept_id = der.drug_concept_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c_de\n    ON de.drug_concept_id = c_de.concept_id\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c_der\n    ON der.drug_concept_id = c_der.concept_id\nWHERE\n    de.drug_exposure_start_date >= der.drug_era_start_date\n    AND de.drug_exposure_start_date <= der.drug_era_end_date\nORDER BY\n    de.person_id, de.drug_exposure_start_date;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CpMBAY89a1_shO_eLq6B2Wnb9ecu7TG0xwqC9BlmGaSENid7UPWZAQtrA8OwKU-mE_qZLW1OVsEZ85rdEPSuJMG8X8wIR88EE3U91u8c6KHXIvY4zuRemkV8QnU0Bpj2p2l8NfaitxUMsFXjjlJavFfFBUzIUr64QF6RgNP8eS4-RmFp1b3-bY3vPy0lHk_CWIHSrnMh"
